# Cloudflare Pages rules for the Sang Event CRM, served at the root of its own host
# (https://events.sangapp.in/) from its own Pages project.
#
# Deliberately empty. The CRM is hash-routed (#/dashboard, #/events, …), so every route
# is a request for "/" as far as the server is concerned and there is nothing to rewrite.
#
# Do NOT add a `/*  /index.html  200` SPA fallback: Pages rejects it as an infinite loop
# (it strips "/index" and re-matches the rule) and silently ignores the whole line. And do
# NOT "fix" it to `/*  /  200` either — these rules run BEFORE static-asset lookup, so that
# form swallows /assets/*, /favicon.svg and /robots.txt and returns the HTML shell for
# them. Unknown paths already fall back to index.html on their own.
